### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Test outage", "serviceId": 1, "severityId": 2}

### Claim (use the id the create returned) - first time: 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents/601/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{"engineerId": 3}

### Claim again - should be 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents/601/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{"engineerId": 5}

### Resolve it
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/incidents/601
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Test outage", "serviceId": 1, "severityId": 2, "assigneeId": 3, "status": "resolved"}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/incidents/601

### Bad foreign key - Postgres rejects it
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Bad", "serviceId": 999, "severityId": 2}